end--// ส่วน 5/10 : หมวดฆาตกร/นายอำเภอ (ออโต้ฆ่า / ฆ่าทั้งหมด / ปามีด / ยิงฆาตกร)
do
    local K = { auto = false, all = false, throw = false, shoot = false }

    local function myParts()
        local c = player.Character
        return c, c and c:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart"), c and c:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
    end

    local function alive(plr)
        local ch = plr.Character
        local h = ch and ch:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
        local r = ch and ch:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
        if h and r and h.Health > 0 then return ch, r end
        return nil
    end

    local function hasTag(t, tag)
        local ok, r = pcall(function() return t:HasTag(tag) end)
        return ok and r
    end

    local function isKnife(t)
        return t:IsA("Tool") and (t.Name:lower():find("knife") ~= nil or hasTag(t, "Weapon_Knife"))
    end

    local function isGun(t)
        if not t:IsA("Tool") then return false end
        local n = t.Name:lower()
        return n:find("gun") ~= nil or n:find("revolver") ~= nil or hasTag(t, "Weapon_Gun")
    end

    local function findTool(test)
        local c = player.Character
        if c then
            for _, t in ipairs(c:GetChildren()) do
                if test(t) then return t end
            end
        end
        local bp = player:FindFirstChild("Backpack")
        if bp then
            for _, t in ipairs(bp:GetChildren()) do
                if test(t) then return t end
            end
        end
        return nil
    end

    -- ถือของ (ถ้าถืออยู่แล้วก็ใช้เลย)
    local function equip(t)
        if not t then return nil end
        local c, _, hum = myParts()
        if not (c and hum) then return nil end
        if t.Parent ~= c then
            pcall(function() hum:EquipTool(t) end)
            task.wait(0.1)
        end
        if t.Parent == c then return t end
        return nil
    end

    local function equipKnife() return equip(findTool(isKnife)) end
    local function equipGun() return equip(findTool(isGun)) end

    local function stab(knife, targetRoot)
        pcall(function() knife:Activate() end)
        local handle = knife:FindFirstChild("Handle")
        if firetouchinterest and handle then
            pcall(firetouchinterest, targetRoot, handle, 0)
            pcall(firetouchinterest, targetRoot, handle, 1)
        end
    end

    -- 1) ออโต้ฆ่า : วาร์ปไปทีละคน แทง 1 ครั้ง
    task.spawn(function()
        while gui.Parent do
            task.wait(0.15)
            if K.auto then
                local ok, err = pcall(function()
                    for _, plr in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
                        if not K.auto then break end
                        if plr ~= player then
                            local ch, r = alive(plr)
                            local _, hrp = myParts()
                            if ch and hrp then
                                local knife = equipKnife()
                                if not knife then
                                    NX.toast("noKnife")
                                    task.wait(1)
                                    break
                                end
                                local pos = (r.CFrame * CFrame.new(0, 0, 3)).Position
                                hrp.CFrame = CFrame.lookAt(pos, r.Position)
                                task.wait(0.12)
                                stab(knife, r)
                                task.wait(0.35)
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end)
                if not ok then warn("[NXKILL]", err) end
            end
        end
    end)

    -- 2) ฆ่าทั้งหมด : ลากทุกคนมาข้างหน้า (ฝั่งเราเท่านั้น คนอื่นเห็นอยู่ที่เดิม)
    RunService.Heartbeat:Connect(function()
        if not K.all then return end
        local _, hrp = myParts()
        if not hrp then return end
        local n = 0
        for _, plr in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
            if plr ~= player then
                local ch, r = alive(plr)
                if ch then
                    n += 1
                    local col = (n - 1) % 5 - 2
                    local row = math.floor((n - 1) / 5)
                    r.CFrame = hrp.CFrame * CFrame.new(col * 2, 0, -4 - row * 2)
                    r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.new(0, 0, 0)
                end
            end
        end
    end)

    task.spawn(function()
        while gui.Parent do
            task.wait(0.3)
            if K.all then
                pcall(function()
                    local knife = equipKnife()
                    if not knife then return end
                    pcall(function() knife:Activate() end)
                    for _, plr in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
                        if plr ~= player then
                            local ch, r = alive(plr)
                            if ch then stab(knife, r) end
                        end
                    end
                end)
            end
        end
    end)

    local function sideButton(yOffset, text, color)
        local b = make("TextButton", {
            AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0.5),
            Position = UDim2.new(1, -10, 0.45, yOffset),
            Size = UDim2.fromOffset(66, 66),
            BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(18, 14, 18),
            TextColor3 = WHITE,
            Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold,
            TextSize = 13,
            Text = text,
            AutoButtonColor = false,
            Visible = false,
            ZIndex = 20,
        }, gui)
        round(b, 14)
        stroke(b, color, 2.5)
        return b
    end

    -- 3) ปามีด : ปุ่มขวาจอ ล็อคคนใกล้สุด
    local throwBtn = sideButton(0, "🔪\nTHROW", RED)

    local function nearestRoot()
        local _, hrp = myParts()
        if not hrp then return nil end
        local best, bd
        for _, plr in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
            if plr ~= player then
                local ch, r = alive(plr)
                if ch then
                    local d = (r.Position - hrp.Position).Magnitude
                    if not bd or d < bd then best, bd = r, d end
                end
            end
        end
        return best
    end

    -- ถ้ารีโมตของแมพคุณชื่ออื่น ให้แก้คำใน names ตรงนี้
    local function findRemote(root, names)
        for _, d in ipairs(root:GetDescendants()) do
            if d:IsA("RemoteEvent") or d:IsA("RemoteFunction") then
                local n = d.Name:lower()
                for _, w in ipairs(names) do
                    if n:find(w) then return d end
                end
            end
        end
        return nil
    end

    throwBtn.Activated:Connect(function()
        local knife = equipKnife()
        if not knife then NX.toast("noKnife") return end
        local r = nearestRoot()
        if not r then NX.toast("noTarget") return end
        local _, hrp = myParts()
        if not hrp then return end
        local aim = r.Position + r.AssemblyLinearVelocity * 0.12
        hrp.CFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hrp.Position, Vector3.new(aim.X, hrp.Position.Y, aim.Z))
        local remote = findRemote(knife, { "throw" }) or findRemote(game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage"), { "throw" })
        if remote and remote:IsA("RemoteEvent") then
            pcall(function() remote:FireServer(CFrame.new(aim), aim) end)
        else
            pcall(function() knife:Activate() end)
        end
    end)

    -- 4) ยิงฆาตกร : ปุ่มขวาจอ ยิงใส่ฆาตกรเสมอ
    local shootBtn = sideButton(80, "🔫\nSHOOT", Color3.fromRGB(60, 140, 255))

    local function murdererRoot()
        if NX.fetchNow then NX.fetchNow() end
        for _, plr in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
            if plr ~= player and NX.getRole and NX.getRole(plr) == "Murderer" then
                local ch, r = alive(plr)
                if ch then return r end
            end
        end
        return nil
    end

    -- ถ้ารีโมตยิงของแมพคุณใช้อาร์กิวเมนต์อื่น ให้แก้บรรทัด FireServer / InvokeServer
    local function fireGun(gun, aim)
        local remote = findRemote(gun, { "shoot", "fire" })
            or findRemote(game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage"), { "shoot", "gunfire" })
        local _, hrp = myParts()
        local origin = hrp and hrp.Position or aim
        if remote then
            local cf = CFrame.lookAt(origin, aim)
            if remote:IsA("RemoteFunction") then
                task.spawn(function()
                    pcall(function() remote:InvokeServer(cf, aim) end)
                end)
            else
                pcall(function() remote:FireServer(cf, aim) end)
            end
        else
            local cam = workspace.CurrentCamera
            if cam then cam.CFrame = CFrame.lookAt(cam.CFrame.Position, aim) end
            pcall(function() gun:Activate() end)
        end
    end

    shootBtn.Activated:Connect(function()
        local gun = equipGun()
        if not gun then NX.toast("noGun") return end
        local r = murdererRoot()
        if not r then NX.toast("noMurder") return end
        local aim = r.Position + r.AssemblyLinearVelocity * 0.1
        local _, hrp = myParts()
        if hrp then
            hrp.CFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hrp.Position, Vector3.new(aim.X, hrp.Position.Y, aim.Z))
        end
        fireGun(gun, aim)
    end)

    makeToggle(murderPage, 1, "mAuto", "mAutoD", function(v) K.auto = v end)
    makeToggle(murderPage, 2, "mAll", "mAllD", function(v) K.all = v end)
    makeToggle(murderPage, 3, "mThrow", "mThrowD", function(v)
        K.throw = v
        throwBtn.Visible = v
    end)
    makeToggle(murderPage, 4, "sShoot", "sShootD", function(v)
        K.shoot = v
        shootBtn.Visible = v
    end)
end--// ส่วน 6/10 : หมวดฟลิ้ง (ฟลิ้งจนตาย แล้วกลับที่เดิม) + หมวดฟาร์ม (เหรียญ + ANTI-AFK)
do
    local BLUE = Color3.fromRGB(40, 110, 230)
    local BLUE_H = Color3.fromRGB(85, 155, 255)
    local busy = false

    local function flingPlayer(plr)
        if busy then NX.toast("flingBusy") return end
        local c = player.Character
        local hrp = c and c:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
        local hum = c and c:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
        local th0 = plr and plr.Character and plr.Character:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
        if not (hrp and th0) then NX.toast("noChar") return end

        busy = true
        NX.flinging = true
        local home = hrp.CFrame
        local homePos = home.Position

        local spin = Instance.new("BodyAngularVelocity")
        spin.MaxTorque = Vector3.new(1e9, 1e9, 1e9)
        spin.P = 1e9
        spin.AngularVelocity = Vector3.new(0, 2e5, 0)
        spin.Parent = hrp

        pcall(function()
            local t0 = os.clock()
            while os.clock() - t0 < 8 and hrp.Parent do
                local tch = plr.Character
                local th = tch and tch:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
                local thum = tch and tch:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
